    "text": "02. The Mediation Boards Commission hereby gives notice Calling upon (a) the Individuals,(b) the Bodies, Organizationsand Institutions of non political nature, and (c) the District Secretaries/ Divisional Secretaries specified hereinafter to submitnames of person who are eligible for appointment as Mediators to the Panel of Mediators for the said Mediation Board areas:",
